        <mxCell id="0XowU2pihiKlK3LS_s_I-53" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;Избыточность&lt;/span&gt; — еще одна важная проблема при интеграции данных. Атрибут может быть избыточным, если его можно «вывести» из другого атрибутa...&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;Book:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em class=&quot;zhvwWe&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;Han, J., Kamber, M., &amp;amp; Jian, P. (2011). &quot;Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
